es are disabled (complete.enabled=false), preventing users from marking them complete. Active tasks (Task 4, c8c38881) have completion toggles enabled and available.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Blocked tasks display prominent warnings: Task 7 shows \\\"Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Complete tax filing\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\", Task 3 shows \\\"Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Test New Task\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\", Task 4b31... shows \\\"Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Test New Task\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\". System handles both single prerequisites (shows named prerequisite) and multiple prerequisites (shows count like \\\"2 prerequisites incomplete\\\" seen earlier).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Task 7 \\\"Submit final report\\\" was blocked (state=\\\"blocked\\\", complete.enabled=false) while Task 4 \\\"Complete tax filing\\\" (a prerequisite) was incomplete. After marking Task 4 as completed, Task 7 became active (state=\\\"active\\\", complete.enabled=null) and eligible for completion. System shows \\\"2 prerequisites completed\\\" for Task 7, confirming prerequisite satisfaction is tracked.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Task c8c38881 \\\"Test New Task\\\" edit form shows prerequisite list. Task 3 \\\"Buy weekly groceries\\\" (which depends on Task c8c38881) is NOT available in the prerequisite options. System prevents circular dependency by excluding Task 3 from selection, even though Task 7 \\\"Submit final report\\\" and completed tasks are available.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Form submit button is disabled when title is empty and when title contains only whitespace (\\\"   \\\"). Attempted submission with both empty and whitespace-only titles left task list unchanged at 4 active, 4 completed tasks. System prevents creation of invalid tasks.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Completed tasks remain available in completed view. Task 1 \\\"Review project proposal\\\" was marked complete and now appears in completed view. Task 4 \\\"Complete tax filing\\\" was also completed and now appears in completed view. Both tasks are accessible with full edit/delete capabilities, not deleted.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Task 7 \\\"Submit final report\\\" was completed (5 completed). Task 4 \\\"Complete tax filing\\\" (a prerequisite) was reopened (moved to active). Task 7 remained in completed view but now displays \\\"Prerequisite \\\\\\\"Complete tax filing\\\\\\\" incomplete\\\" warning. Task 7's complete toggle is disabled (complete.enabled=false) to prevent invalid state. System prevents completed+blocked state by disabling further state changes.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Dashed line visual connections exist but hovering over them does not trigger a popup showing dependency chain.\", \"actual\": \"Visual dashed-line connection elements found in DOM (class=\\\"bg-dashed-line\\\"). However, hovering over these elements does not reliably display a tooltip with dependency information. Dependency information is shown when hovering over the prerequisite warning (IX-20), not over the visual connections themselves.\", \"evidence\": \"Confirmed visual elements exist: document.querySelector('.bg-dashed-line') returns elements. Confirmed hover tooltips exist for prerequisites, but not linked to dashed line hover events.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Hovering over blocked task warning (Task 3 \\\"Buy weekly groceries\\\") displays a tooltip showing \\\"Dependency Chain\\\", the prerequisite task \\\"Test New Task\\\", and its status